# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Copilot instructions

Read ../AGENTS.md and the canonical project context:
`docs/agent-governance/core.md`, `docs/agent-governance/architecture.md`,
`docs/agent-governance/planning.md`, `docs/quality/testing.md` and
`docs/operations/configuration.md`. These paths are repository-root relative.
Use ../CONTRIBUTING.md and the project-owned development command map for actual
commands, not Backbone source checks.

Require an authorized Task Packet and independent plan review for non-trivial work.
Keep implementation, quality, independent review and triage separate; repair
confirmed findings only and use scoped Delta review. Preserve stricter instructions,
real revision-bound evidence and human merge/release gates. Do not publish secrets,
force-push, overwrite unrelated work or assume deployment/provider permission.
Native role files and skills do not prove actual loading or independent review.
